WEBVTT

00:16.450 --> 00:20.050
Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa

00:20.050 --> 00:23.690
Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru

00:23.690 --> 00:27.680
Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete

00:31.030 --> 00:34.600
Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga

00:34.600 --> 00:38.230
Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku

00:38.230 --> 00:42.190
Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase

00:45.570 --> 00:52.810
Tatoe hitori de mo kimi no
koto shinjite itai

00:52.810 --> 01:00.090
Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu

01:00.090 --> 01:03.730
Nani o mitsukete yukou

01:03.730 --> 01:07.360
Kokoro o hakidashite

01:07.360 --> 01:14.640
Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara

01:14.640 --> 01:18.270
Nani o mitsumete iyou

01:18.270 --> 01:25.010
Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o

01:25.010 --> 01:28.780
Let it go, shinjiyou

01:33.050 --> 01:37.030
The puppet that appeared
before the Sanzo Party...

01:37.030 --> 01:40.290
Ni hao, Cho Gonou the murderer.

01:42.000 --> 01:44.870
Why does it know your old name?!

01:45.830 --> 01:50.840
The puppet was a shikigami
unleashed by Chin Yisou,

01:50.840 --> 01:54.540
a mysterious fortune-teller deeply
involved with Hakkai's past.

01:56.140 --> 01:57.610
Gojyo, look out!

02:00.420 --> 02:01.920
Gojyo!

02:01.920 --> 02:03.380
You...

02:04.150 --> 02:05.620
Damn puppet...

02:06.560 --> 02:09.580
Come on out, Chin Yisou.

02:12.890 --> 02:16.190
Well, well, you cut quite
a dashing figure.

02:19.030 --> 02:24.540
Chin Yisou's true aim was not
to kill Hakkai

02:24.540 --> 02:26.470
but to destroy him.

02:26.470 --> 02:28.200
That's really low!

02:37.150 --> 02:41.490
He's really going to lose some
of his little friends.

02:44.830 --> 02:46.290
You just try it.

03:01.480 --> 03:03.740
What's going on? Neither
of them is moving.

03:04.410 --> 03:06.810
They're both looking for an opening
in the other.

03:08.120 --> 03:10.640
Hey, you dirty bastard!

03:13.520 --> 03:15.590
You just try doing something to Sanzo!

03:15.590 --> 03:17.060
I'll make sure you pay for it!

03:17.690 --> 03:23.300
My goodness, your pet here
is quite loyal.

03:23.300 --> 03:25.230
Stay back, Goku!

03:25.230 --> 03:27.170
He certainly howls a lot.

03:31.670 --> 03:34.510
I'm amazed at your bold words,

03:34.510 --> 03:37.340
considering you can barely
stay on your feet.

03:39.180 --> 03:41.420
You really have a broken leg?

03:41.420 --> 03:42.420
I told you so from the start!

03:42.420 --> 03:43.750
Sanzo, let's split up here.
I told you so from the start!

03:43.750 --> 03:45.390
Sanzo, let's split up here.

03:45.390 --> 03:47.120
I get you.

03:47.120 --> 03:50.630
Gojyo's probably not at his best
because of what happened yesterday.

03:50.630 --> 03:52.090
And we saw how Goku is.

03:56.260 --> 03:57.730
Isn't that right?!

03:59.070 --> 04:02.230
A surprise attack. What a cheap tactic.

04:03.000 --> 04:05.130
We don't need to take that from you!

04:08.240 --> 04:09.340
We're going after him, Hakkai!

04:09.340 --> 04:09.740
Gojyo, please take care of Goku.
We're going after him, Hakkai!

04:09.740 --> 04:11.280
Gojyo, please take care of Goku.

04:11.280 --> 04:12.880
Oh, hey!

04:12.880 --> 04:15.720
Bastards! They left us
behind on purpose!

04:15.720 --> 04:17.790
For real?! You're kidding!

04:17.790 --> 04:21.290
He's not such an easy opponent!
We're going after them, monkey!

04:21.290 --> 04:22.760
You got that right!

04:24.360 --> 04:27.060
Your wound from yesterday still
hasn't completely healed?

04:28.430 --> 04:29.760
Useless bastard.

04:29.760 --> 04:29.930
I SO don't need to take that from you,
you broken-boned monkey!
Useless bastard.

04:29.930 --> 04:32.900
I SO don't need to take that from you,
you broken-boned monkey!

04:32.900 --> 04:34.990
Quit calling me monkey all the time,
you perverted water sprite!

04:40.310 --> 04:41.780
Have we lost sight of him?

04:42.610 --> 04:44.270
No, that's not it.

04:45.880 --> 04:50.650
Chin Yisou, you're going to kill me,
right?! You better not miss!

04:53.690 --> 04:55.620
He's sure to be around
here somewhere.

04:56.560 --> 05:00.960
Right now, his goal is to kill me
right before your eyes.

05:02.060 --> 05:03.530
That's not all.

05:06.500 --> 05:10.870
His goal is to destroy me.

05:11.570 --> 05:13.270
I'm so happy for you.

05:16.880 --> 05:20.210
Her suffering has now come to an end.

05:23.420 --> 05:26.320
My, my, what a terrifying look.

05:28.320 --> 05:29.790
You must...

05:34.730 --> 05:38.760
...want to kill me really badly.

05:40.840 --> 05:43.040
But you're really amazing.

05:43.040 --> 05:48.200
You killed all the demons
in the castle by yourself.

05:49.010 --> 05:52.340
I can't believe it's the work
of a human.

05:53.310 --> 05:58.290
Yes, yes, it's only a legend,
but they say,

05:58.290 --> 06:01.160
a human that has bathed in the blood
of a thousand demons

06:01.160 --> 06:03.820
becomes a demon himself.

06:04.530 --> 06:07.230
Is that not wonderful?

06:07.230 --> 06:08.700
Bastard!

06:11.170 --> 06:13.530
I was sure he had died then.

06:14.940 --> 06:19.500
But there's no mistaking those eyes.
They're the same as then.

06:28.720 --> 06:30.290
Sanzo...

06:30.290 --> 06:33.550
What is it? Ask me something stupid,
and I'll kill you.

06:34.760 --> 06:36.590
Then maybe I'd better not.

06:36.590 --> 06:38.580
You trying to pick a fight?

06:41.630 --> 06:45.530
Is it really alright for me to be here?

06:49.570 --> 06:52.870
That's really stupid. Don't you
ask me that again.

06:53.610 --> 06:55.080
Is that so?

07:00.080 --> 07:02.070
You wouldn't betray me.

07:08.520 --> 07:09.990
Am I right?

07:12.030 --> 07:14.890
You never play fair.

07:16.130 --> 07:19.590
How could I betray you after
what you just said?

07:20.640 --> 07:22.640
Hey, let me down!

07:22.640 --> 07:25.710
Quit struggling, you monkey!
You can't even stand by yourself!

07:25.710 --> 07:27.840
You're pushing it too!

07:27.840 --> 07:30.850
Then quiet down a little for me!

07:30.850 --> 07:32.380
Oh, fine!

07:32.380 --> 07:35.880
But how far did Sanzo
and Hakkai go?!

07:35.880 --> 07:37.580
Hakkai's the one I'm worried about.

07:39.850 --> 07:42.410
His mental state.

07:44.690 --> 07:46.660
Hakkai will be all right.

07:48.430 --> 07:52.830
Since he said that as long as there
are people who believe in him,

07:52.830 --> 07:54.500
he'll protect himself and survive.

07:56.300 --> 07:59.570
Because he doesn't want
to shame himself.

07:59.570 --> 08:02.980
So... So, he'll be all right.

08:07.320 --> 08:09.980
Gonna pick up the speed! Better not
fall off, you stupid monkey!

08:09.980 --> 08:11.710
Don't call me a stupid monkey,
damn water sprite!

08:24.130 --> 08:25.600
He's here.

08:34.310 --> 08:35.780
Above?!

08:37.410 --> 08:41.680
Are you done with your
final little chat?

08:42.320 --> 08:45.520
I've had enough of your cheesy,
puffed-up speeches!

08:45.520 --> 08:46.850
They disgust me!

08:46.850 --> 08:47.020
Is that so? Then please allow me
to take up a little of your time.
They disgust me!

08:47.020 --> 08:51.580
Is that so? Then please allow me
to take up a little of your time.

08:52.830 --> 08:54.850
I'll end this shortly.

08:56.700 --> 09:02.800
Cho Gonou, you killed my entire clan,
all for just one woman.

09:03.570 --> 09:06.470
For one woman and my other life.

09:07.340 --> 09:13.510
I lost my entire clan and even my
own father, Hyakugan Maoh,

09:13.510 --> 09:16.550
at your hands. No?

09:16.550 --> 09:18.190
So what?

09:18.190 --> 09:21.590
My, you know of this too?

09:23.730 --> 09:27.460
You have a good friend, Cho Gonou.

09:27.460 --> 09:29.990
I'm sure he'll be worth losing.

09:30.930 --> 09:35.440
I don't care what you say to me at all,

09:35.440 --> 09:41.860
but I'll personally make sure you
never lay a finger on Sanzo!

09:44.610 --> 09:47.640
I mustn't lay a single finger on him?

09:49.620 --> 09:55.780
I see, I can't touch him then?
Oh, dear, what a problem.

09:57.060 --> 09:58.550
In that case...

10:01.730 --> 10:04.860
Hakkai, you do it!

10:07.300 --> 10:09.170
For me!

10:11.110 --> 10:16.040
Show me your face as you
agonize and suffer in joy!

10:17.180 --> 10:19.150
This can't be...

10:23.520 --> 10:24.990
Hakkai!

10:25.650 --> 10:29.750
Stay back. Please, don't
come near me, Sanzo.

10:32.260 --> 10:33.730
Hakkai!

10:38.430 --> 10:39.900
Hakkai...

10:41.600 --> 10:43.760
My arm has a mind of its own.

10:44.710 --> 10:47.640
What a truly frail creature.

10:47.640 --> 10:51.410
It's so easy to work my way into
the crevices of your heart.

10:51.410 --> 10:55.180
Now, hurry, put him out of his misery.

10:55.180 --> 10:56.920
No!

10:56.920 --> 11:01.620
Goodness, why not? You've
taken so many lives.

11:02.260 --> 11:04.460
It should be so easy for you to do.

11:04.460 --> 11:10.160
Now, take your hatred and kill him,
just as you killed me.

11:12.270 --> 11:14.740
It'll just be one more death

11:14.740 --> 11:17.900
added to the many that already
taint your hands.

11:26.080 --> 11:26.950
Hakkai!

11:26.950 --> 11:27.580
What's going on?!
Hakkai!

11:27.580 --> 11:28.810
What's going on?!

11:31.220 --> 11:33.550
Monkey, don't push yourself.

11:33.550 --> 11:35.350
I'm not pushing myself!

11:36.560 --> 11:37.990
I know that.

11:38.790 --> 11:45.790
Have you had enough time
to remember me by now?

11:48.170 --> 11:49.640
That time...

11:55.510 --> 11:56.980
Bastard...

12:01.520 --> 12:05.540
Have you really become a demon?

12:13.260 --> 12:16.230
I was sure you died then!

12:17.230 --> 12:19.000
I killed you!

12:19.000 --> 12:24.510
You're right, you did an excellent job
slicing into me.

12:24.510 --> 12:26.540
Cut down by you, who had
become a demon

12:26.540 --> 12:29.600
by being bathed in the blood
of a thousand demons.

12:33.110 --> 12:38.350
But right before I breathed
my last, I took this.

12:39.050 --> 12:45.560
I buried this in my body through one
of the wounds you gave me.

12:46.530 --> 12:51.020
This man turned his own corpse
into a shikigami!

12:52.070 --> 12:55.930
Do you know why I did such a thing?

13:00.440 --> 13:04.240
It was to meet you, Cho Gonou.

13:06.550 --> 13:10.180
Because I wanted to see you suffer.

13:10.180 --> 13:11.720
No...

13:11.720 --> 13:14.420
I want to hear your voice
in agony as you suffer.

13:14.420 --> 13:15.890
No!

13:16.660 --> 13:19.630
I want to take everything from you
and destroy you.

13:31.710 --> 13:33.470
Sanzo...

13:38.280 --> 13:40.110
Sanzo!

13:40.110 --> 13:42.080
Sanzo! Sanzo!

13:42.880 --> 13:44.720
Sanzo!

13:44.720 --> 13:46.190
Sa...

13:57.830 --> 14:02.240
What a truly simple thing, Cho Gonou.

14:03.040 --> 14:04.540
Sanzo!

14:04.540 --> 14:11.380
My, it seems your friends are here.
Please explain it to them.

14:11.380 --> 14:13.210
Exactly what you did.

14:14.420 --> 14:17.910
Now, it's time for you
to lose everything.

14:23.590 --> 14:25.060
What's going on here?

14:25.690 --> 14:27.500
Sanzo?

14:27.500 --> 14:28.960
What's going on?

14:29.760 --> 14:31.530
Don't tell me that bastard
Chin Yisou did it.

14:32.430 --> 14:34.370
I did it.

14:35.670 --> 14:37.140
What did you say?!

14:38.340 --> 14:42.740
I did it!

14:44.580 --> 14:45.940
What're you doing, Hakkai?!

14:48.420 --> 14:53.190
It's no use. He's as good
as my puppet now.

14:53.190 --> 14:54.780
Stop it, Hakkai!

14:58.030 --> 14:59.490
Run, Goku!

15:15.480 --> 15:19.040
It was all an act?

15:21.320 --> 15:24.080
Don't play us for fools, you moron.

15:25.650 --> 15:28.920
Sanzo! Damn it, so you WERE acting!

15:28.920 --> 15:32.830
Well, I figured as much.
It was a hammy performance.

15:32.830 --> 15:34.430
Shut up.

15:34.430 --> 15:36.600
We're sorry to have troubled you.

15:36.600 --> 15:39.120
Not at all, we enjoyed it quite a bit.

15:39.770 --> 15:43.500
I see, what an interesting performance.

15:44.870 --> 15:49.610
He'd probably bite his own tongue
rather than strangle me to death.

15:50.580 --> 15:52.710
I believe you said

15:52.710 --> 15:56.150
it was easy to work your way
into the crevices of my heart.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.720
But unfortunately for you,

16:00.720 --> 16:04.120
my heart isn't big enough to
have room for crevices.

16:05.260 --> 16:07.920
It's like, don't underestimate me,
you bastard.

16:10.700 --> 16:14.030
You'll die once more.

16:19.110 --> 16:20.870
Bastard! What's so funny?!

16:22.040 --> 16:24.710
I don't mind dying again,

16:24.710 --> 16:28.740
but do you think you can defeat me
with just your Qigong techniques?

16:30.890 --> 16:36.350
Or will you remove your demon
power limiters to fight?!

16:37.120 --> 16:38.560
Just as you did then?!

16:38.560 --> 16:40.860
There should be no need for that.

16:40.860 --> 16:42.330
What?!

16:45.270 --> 16:46.860
Have you lost your mind?!

16:51.440 --> 16:53.710
I believe it was here, wasn't it?

16:53.710 --> 16:56.200
This is where I stabbed you
three years ago.

17:01.620 --> 17:05.720
It's useless, your Qigong can't...

17:05.720 --> 17:10.520
Don't worry, there's an alternate use
for Qigong techniques.

17:25.710 --> 17:30.210
I'm completely disappointed in you.

17:30.210 --> 17:33.240
I thought you'd provide
more entertainment.

17:34.080 --> 17:35.550
Thank you very much.

17:36.680 --> 17:38.150
Though it was unfortunate for you.

17:39.620 --> 17:42.590
Cho Gonou...

17:42.590 --> 17:44.060
No...

17:47.700 --> 17:50.820
I'm Cho Hakkai.

17:51.630 --> 17:56.660
In the end, I despise you from
the bottom of my heart,

17:58.910 --> 18:02.070
a hypocrite who has no scent of life.

18:03.410 --> 18:07.540
What a coincidence. I hate you too.

18:11.450 --> 18:12.920
I...

18:13.890 --> 18:18.920
...am not a creature like you,
without a past or a future.

18:28.370 --> 18:30.270
You perverted water sprite!

18:30.270 --> 18:32.970
What're you doing?! Quit it!

18:33.370 --> 18:35.540
Ooh, looks cool.

18:35.540 --> 18:38.610
You bastard! Stop kidding around,
you stinking water sprite!

18:38.610 --> 18:42.140
Shut up! At least be quiet
when your leg's broken!

18:44.120 --> 18:46.550
Oh, my head bone broke too!

18:46.550 --> 18:48.190
Is your brain all scrambled too?

18:48.190 --> 18:50.660
This thing has a brain?

18:50.660 --> 18:52.150
Of course I do!

18:55.130 --> 18:57.100
That was fun.

18:57.100 --> 18:58.930
You're very energetic,

18:58.930 --> 19:01.030
for all that you're supposed
to be an invalid too.

19:01.900 --> 19:03.500
Speak for yourself.

19:03.500 --> 19:06.140
You look like a weight was
lifted off your shoulders.

19:06.140 --> 19:10.740
I suppose. In some ways,
he was my other self.

19:15.780 --> 19:19.180
I've lived dragging my past
along with me.

19:20.720 --> 19:24.920
Perhaps he was my ghost
from the past.

19:28.530 --> 19:34.300
Right now, I wish my lifeline
were just a little longer.

19:36.640 --> 19:40.040
Because I have a short lifeline.

19:41.380 --> 19:45.080
So, I suppose I won't get to live long.

19:45.080 --> 19:47.550
Then, all you have to do is this!

19:49.620 --> 19:51.080
Right?

19:53.150 --> 19:55.990
Hey, monkey, the least you can do
is clean up after yourself!

19:55.990 --> 19:57.620
That hurt!

19:59.390 --> 20:00.900
You're an idiot!

20:00.900 --> 20:05.420
Kanan, I'd like to live for myself
for a while longer.

20:08.300 --> 20:09.740
Oh, no...

20:10.570 --> 20:13.370
This is permanent ink.

20:13.370 --> 20:14.840
Yeah, permanent ink.

20:15.410 --> 20:17.540
It's not going to come off.

20:17.540 --> 20:19.010
Nope, not going to come off.

20:21.120 --> 20:22.580
But maybe that's okay.

20:26.650 --> 20:28.620
Yes, I suppose so.

20:28.620 --> 20:30.320
Now, let's get going!

20:30.320 --> 20:31.590
Right with you!

20:31.590 --> 20:31.830
Hey, Sanzo, if I have steak for dinner,
Right with you!

20:31.830 --> 20:34.530
Hey, Sanzo, if I have steak for dinner,

20:34.530 --> 20:35.560
you think my bones will stick?

20:35.560 --> 20:36.030
You think my bones will stick?
Like hell they will, you idiot!

20:36.030 --> 20:38.330
Like hell they will, you idiot!

20:41.940 --> 20:48.340
Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru

20:48.340 --> 20:53.680
Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku

20:53.680 --> 20:59.190
Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de

20:59.190 --> 21:02.590
Ue o miagerunda

21:02.590 --> 21:08.400
Donna arifureta shiin mo enji-tsuzukeru

21:08.400 --> 21:13.830
Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa

21:13.830 --> 21:19.140
Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou

21:19.140 --> 21:23.080
You must fight against yourself

21:30.080 --> 21:33.750
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:33.750 --> 21:35.690
Repeating is one change

21:35.690 --> 21:39.790
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:39.790 --> 21:43.960
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:43.960 --> 21:46.630
Go forward now

21:46.630 --> 21:51.670
Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de

21:51.670 --> 21:57.110
Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau

21:57.110 --> 22:02.520
Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou

22:02.520 --> 22:06.580
You must fight against yourself
